OL,3,GNEWSASchool set to be completely
OL,4,Arebuilt in programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FA school's buildings are expected to be
OL,7,Fentirely replaced by 2030 after it was
OL,8,Fchosen to be part of a government
OL,9,Fschool rebuilding programme.
OL,11,FJohn O'Gaunt School in Hungerford,
OL,12,FBerkshire, initially bid to the
OL,13,FDepartment for Education to replace its
OL,14,Fsports hall and one of its blocks.
OL,16,FBut the school, which has about 440
OL,17,Fpupils, said that it became "apparent"
OL,18,Fthat its whole complex needed to be
OL,19,Freplaced as surveys across its site
OL,20,Fprogressed.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
