OL,3,GNEWSASchool set to be completely
OL,4,Arebuilt in programme
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher Richard Hawthorne said the
OL,7,Fschool community was "completely
OL,8,Fthrilled" by the plan and that it was a
OL,9,F"massive story" for Hungerford and its
OL,10,Fsurrounding villages.
